 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "114-115 address the Prophet ﷺ (and the community): no plate on «وأقم» or «واصبر»; a night-and-day disc for «طرفي النهار وزلفا من الليل», light for «إن الحسنات يذهبن السيئات». 114:5-7 is not glossed (the tafsirs name different prayers). 116:1-18 is not glossed (the «فلولا… إلا قليلا» sentence is too long for one chip); a candle for «إلا قليلا ممن أنجينا منهم», a jewel for «ما أترفوا فيه». 117 is not glossed (As-Sa'di gives two readings). 118:8-10 is not glossed so that «ولا يزالون مختلفين… إلا من رحم ربك» is not split. Hell, jinn and Iblis are never drawn. The plan's «إقامة الصلاة» restated the verse. STAGING v4: c1 (114-115): the prayer at the two ends of the day and in the hours of the night, addressed to the Prophet and his community, shown as the ruling in everyday life: three believers praying in a prayer hall at dusk (no imam, no one facing them, no plate during the prayer, no look up): they stand in prayer (114:2), bow (114:4), prostrate (114:6), sit (114:9) and stand up (114:11), so the plates come only after the prayer; a light plate for a reminder for those who remember (114:12-14; good deeds remove evil deeds is recited over the prayer itself, As-Sa'di: the five prayers are among the greatest good deeds); be patient (115:1) is held wide, nobody faces an empty side; geometric for Allah does not waste the reward (115:2-7) and a soft sparkle on them for the doers of good (115:7). c2 (116-117): the generations before: a town by day, a few believers (three countable figures in light robes) beside the wrongdoers drawn as an uncountable crowd in dark robes, so the few read as few (these are not idol worshippers); nothing is acted inside why were there not (116:1-13), the camera only (on the men for corruption, 116:11); the camera on the few (116:14) with a candle plate for except a few (116:14-18) and a sparkle for whom We saved (116:17); the camera on the wrongdoers (116:19), a jewel plate for the luxury they followed (116:23-24, worldly luxury, not Paradise); geometric for your Lord would not destroy the towns unjustly (117:1-6), the camera on the believers for while their people are reformers (117:7). c3 (118-119) stays ambient (geometric): Allah's will, His mercy and His word to fill Hell with jinn and men are His acts and the unseen (no fire, no jinn); params.quiet over 118:1-7 and all of 119. Plates: geometric (118:2-7), a two-paths plate for they will not cease to differ (118:8-10), geometric for except whom your Lord has mercy on (119:1-6), a seal for the word of your Lord is fulfilled (119:7-15). Cover: the believers in prayer (the pillar of steadfastness)."
